<body>
    <h1>Screenlock / Screensaver Options in IGEL OS 12</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <p local-id=3D"d7fec1fe-8eaa-42ec-b703-41a2588db9c8">This article s=
hows how to configure the setting options for the screenlock and the screen=
saver in IGEL OS.</p>
<hr local-id=3D"bd2978b2-909e-4cda-8096-ed9de1aa5671">
<p local-id=3D"416b79fa-e157-4e8c-a25e-3a791ba2ae58">Menu path: <strong>Use=
r Interface &gt; Screenlock / Screensaver &gt; Options</strong><br></p><spa=
n class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-left-wrapper confluence-e=
mbedded-manual-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image confluence-con=
tent-image-border image-left" alt=3D"Screenlock options in IGEL OS" width=
=3D"468" loading=3D"lazy" src=3D"9aac83befbdc724ac5f5a74d814834c68968af8de3=
961a96b73394efd68ebb04" data-image-src=3D"https://igel-jira.atlassian.net/w=
iki/download/attachments/73302255/image-20260129-130611.png?version=3D1&amp=
;modificationDate=3D1769691972487&amp;cacheVersion=3D1&amp;api=3Dv2" data-h=
eight=3D"601" data-width=3D"1153" data-unresolved-comment-count=3D"0" data-=
linked-resource-id=3D"859930682" data-linked-resource-version=3D"1" data-li=
nked-resource-type=3D"attachment" data-linked-resource-default-alias=3D"ima=
ge-20260129-130611.png" data-base-url=3D"https://igel-jira.atlassian.net/wi=
ki" data-linked-resource-content-type=3D"image/png" data-linked-resource-co=
ntainer-id=3D"73302255" data-linked-resource-container-version=3D"8" data-m=
edia-id=3D"dcdead05-c1f5-41db-a5f2-d852f64bed41" data-media-type=3D"file" h=
eight=3D"243"></span>
<p local-id=3D"16d42979-2530-4336-9408-ecfabb67d1aa"></p>
<p local-id=3D"e115483fc4e5"><strong>Start automatically</strong></p>
<ul class=3D"inline-task-list" data-inline-tasks-content-id=3D"73302255">
<li class=3D"checked" data-inline-task-id=3D"1"><span class=3D"placeholder-=
inline-tasks">The screenlock and screensaver starts automatically if there =
is no activity on the device within the <strong>Timeout</strong> period. De=
pending on the configurations under <strong>Require password to unlock (scr=
eenlock)</strong> and&nbsp;<strong>Allow administrator password</strong>, t=
he screen can be unlocked with the local user/administrator password. (Defa=
ult)</span></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"939d7b30-80a5-49da-a39b-55f76148516b"></p>
<p local-id=3D"be7b0539-e412-479a-a2b3-330687bd6ab2"><strong>Timeout</stron=
g></p>
<p local-id=3D"92625749-0185-4bbd-95a0-b9ca142e6082">Period of time in minu=
tes before the screenlock and the screensaver starts. (Default:&nbsp;5)</p>
<p local-id=3D"403213b8-0761-43dd-9c5e-4673cc5d0c86"></p>
<p local-id=3D"e34c1acc-2eca-46ef-ba28-d4f1dcb82c43"><strong>Require passwo=
rd to unlock (screenlock)</strong></p>
<ul class=3D"inline-task-list" data-inline-tasks-content-id=3D"73302255">
<li class=3D"checked" data-inline-task-id=3D"2"><span class=3D"placeholder-=
inline-tasks">If a user is logged in, the same authentication is required t=
o unlock the screen. For example, i<span class=3D"legacy-color-text-blue3">=
f the user is&nbsp;</span>logged in via Active Directory (AD)<span class=3D=
"legacy-color-text-blue3">, the AD credentials are used&nbsp;to unlock the =
screen. For more information, see </span><a href=3D"https://igel-jira.atlas=
sian.net/wiki/spaces/IGELOS12BSDOCE/pages/73302730/Active+Directory+Kerbero=
s+-+Enable+Login+in+IGEL+OS+12" data-linked-resource-id=3D"73302730" data-l=
inked-resource-version=3D"9" data-linked-resource-type=3D"page">Active Dire=
ctory/Kerberos - Enable Login in IGEL OS 12</a> <span class=3D"legacy-color=
-text-blue3">. </span>The authentication methods can be configured under <s=
trong>Security &gt; Logon</strong>. For more information, see <a href=3D"ht=
tps://igel-jira.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/IGELOS12BSDOCE/pages/73308605/Log=
on+Settings+in+IGEL+OS+12" data-linked-resource-id=3D"73308605" data-linked=
-resource-version=3D"2" data-linked-resource-type=3D"page">Logon Settings i=
n IGEL OS 12</a> .<span class=3D"legacy-color-text-blue3">&nbsp;</span>(Def=
ault)</span></li>
<li data-inline-task-id=3D"3"><span class=3D"placeholder-inline-tasks">The =
screen can be unlocked without authentication.</span></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"7083fe9d-4eed-4b47-aa14-15dc2be429f4"></p>
<p local-id=3D"a0afd5b7-ab7d-4e72-85c4-cce8ef0ef180"><strong>Different scre=
enlock timeout</strong></p>
<ul class=3D"inline-task-list" data-inline-tasks-content-id=3D"73302255">
<li class=3D"checked" data-inline-task-id=3D"4"><span class=3D"placeholder-=
inline-tasks">You can specify a time limit for the screenlock to activate s=
eparately from the screensaver.&nbsp;</span></li>
<li data-inline-task-id=3D"5"><span class=3D"placeholder-inline-tasks">The =
same time limit will be used for the screenlock and the screensaver. This m=
eans that after the set time the screen will be locked and then the screens=
aver will appear. (Default)</span></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"3c791529-d04c-4fe5-a825-f61815f2ec3b"></p>
<p local-id=3D"445a8873-83c7-4247-bbaf-51a5ea46e5eb"><strong>Screenlock tim=
eout</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"9ee888d7-8efa-4d26-b8be-9dd270a3d9f3">Period of time in minu=
tes before the screenlock starts. (Default:&nbsp;5)</p>
<p local-id=3D"0aa84e9363fb"></p>
<p local-id=3D"e4db1761d7ef"><strong>Hide username</strong></p>
<ul class=3D"inline-task-list" data-inline-tasks-content-id=3D"73302255">
<li class=3D"checked" data-inline-task-id=3D"6"><span class=3D"placeholder-=
inline-tasks">The username is not displayed on the locked screen. This appl=
ies to the user logged in via <a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"https://kb=
.igel.com/en/igel-os-base-system/current/active-directory-kerberos-enable-l=
ogin-in-igel-os-" rel=3D"nofollow">Kerberos / Active Directory</a> or as a =
<a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"https://kb.igel.com/en/igel-os-base-syst=
em/current/local-user-login-in-igel-os-12" rel=3D"nofollow">local user</a>.=
</span></li>
<li data-inline-task-id=3D"7"><span class=3D"placeholder-inline-tasks">The =
username is shown on the locked screen. (Default)</span></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"8bc3be9d19fe"></p>
<p local-id=3D"f8e6b2c2-6b4f-4066-ad2a-6fd1c143158b"><strong>Allow administ=
rator password</strong></p>
<ul class=3D"inline-task-list" data-inline-tasks-content-id=3D"73302255">
<li class=3D"checked" data-inline-task-id=3D"8"><span class=3D"placeholder-=
inline-tasks">Access is allowed for the user and the administrator. The scr=
een can also be unlocked by the administrator password, if the administrato=
r password is configured. For more information, see <a href=3D"https://igel=
-jira.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/IGELOS12BSDOCE/pages/73302358/Password+and+=
User+Types+in+IGEL+OS+12" data-linked-resource-id=3D"73302358" data-linked-=
resource-version=3D"7" data-linked-resource-type=3D"page">Password and User=
 Types in IGEL OS 12</a> .</span></li>
<li data-inline-task-id=3D"9"><span class=3D"placeholder-inline-tasks">Acce=
ss is allowed for the user only. (Default)</span></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"6a27e4d3-329c-4ad1-b32e-343e8f633e79"></p>
<p local-id=3D"6a7d3c0e-d31a-4655-b38e-5d010e4ed721"><strong>Countdown dura=
tion in seconds</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"d1c9991f-97cd-4684-9ee3-ecbcef8b5926">Countdown time after w=
hich the screenlock is initiated. If the value is 0, the screen is locked w=
ithout a countdown. (Default:&nbsp;0)</p>
<div class=3D"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-inf=
ormation">
<span class=3D"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-info confluence-informa=
tion-macro-icon"></span>
<div class=3D"confluence-information-macro-body">
<p local-id=3D"7d42b7ab-efa9-4248-8bb4-73da05314ec2">The appearance of the =
digits for the countdown is specified together with the settings for the cl=
ock display under<strong>&nbsp;Screenlock / Screensaver &gt; Screensaver</s=
trong>.&nbsp;The following parameters are relevant for the countdown:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"d71d1a66-6f5b-421f-a1ca-0cdade32c417">
<li local-id=3D"3f2b6c37-0ed8-4651-bc83-d493b91ac620">
<p local-id=3D"11022631-178b-4416-aa9f-6d6c844dae3a"><strong>Clock display =
monitor</strong></p></li>
<li local-id=3D"7153082b-ad4e-49b4-b771-6269ed47ec06">
<p local-id=3D"ca34dd16-c6a9-459b-9401-2ea2092c6dcd"><strong>Show seconds</=
strong></p></li>
<li local-id=3D"1f4ea5a1-3f35-42ff-84df-688ccdef6909">
<p local-id=3D"868a9410-43c3-4e4c-a5ee-3055b46ab732"><strong>Horizontal clo=
ck position</strong></p></li>
<li local-id=3D"13195111-f7fb-47da-ab51-8654ac6b38c9">
<p local-id=3D"97c65a03-7e92-4707-b60c-f31e8141c4b5"><strong>Vertical clock=
 position</strong></p></li>
<li local-id=3D"50edafca-d2fe-40c8-aca5-ab0b562744be">
<p local-id=3D"068733c7-7dc7-43cf-8734-44df4507b3ee"><strong>Clock backgrou=
nd color</strong></p></li>
<li local-id=3D"e319f0c1-00f7-4b77-b3a8-a24323048bc9">
<p local-id=3D"5480ed66-14ec-4ec8-bcc3-a9dfcb949737"><strong>Clock foregrou=
nd color</strong></p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"4cc78401-414e-4bd2-9341-ffe7bdb074ae">For detailed informati=
on, see <a href=3D"https://igel-jira.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/IGELOS12BSDO=
CE/pages/73302353/Screensaver+in+IGEL+OS+12" data-linked-resource-id=3D"733=
02353" data-linked-resource-version=3D"3" data-linked-resource-type=3D"page=
">Screensaver in IGEL OS 12</a> .</p>
</div>
</div>
<p local-id=3D"52a74695-5563-4873-8ffe-cfc4d9746df3"></p>
<p local-id=3D"74974dab-f6d8-49ce-88e7-f01c31ac4f12"><strong>Countdown visu=
al effect</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"9ec95c0a-9e39-4c1d-85e1-86b682f83bf1">While the countdown is=
 running, a current screenshot is displayed in the background. This paramet=
er determines the visual effect that the screenshot will be displayed with.=
<br>
Possible options:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"d3ae336d-2288-460b-ac19-d5d71ddbeab1">
<li local-id=3D"a82763b7-7f49-4569-ad83-b40f1a25e448">
<p local-id=3D"b6b82ce5-e561-4ca5-a100-4216f9ca231a"><strong>Dark screensho=
t</strong></p></li>
<li local-id=3D"7e5db325-b704-4624-8842-0ededa848026">
<p local-id=3D"7ceb0605-292b-447c-9f1a-e1ee0623f846"><strong>Gray screensho=
t</strong></p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"aae4d86a-d8cf-4fc6-9788-b8a339fa78e0"></p>
<p local-id=3D"676a0bc3-482f-4fca-ad1d-2d29cab66365"><strong>Countdown back=
ground image</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"bd789728-c49f-4056-b137-767cbfdc9208">Path and file name of =
an image file, which is displayed in the background while the countdown is =
running. This background image is displayed instead of the screenshot, if t=
he path and file name are valid; if the field is empty, the screenshot is d=
isplayed. Supported file formats: JPEG, PNG, GIF. Example:&nbsp;<code>/imag=
es/image.jpg</code></p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
